WEBVTT

00:10:57.873 --> 00:11:00.346
would be hard-pressed to present.

00:11:00.905 --> 00:11:02.820
And they went on and on,

00:11:02.844 --> 00:11:04.254
and the soldier watched.

00:11:04.808 --> 00:11:08.072
And then he sat there for a full minute
after they were finished

00:11:08.096 --> 00:11:10.694
and looked at us,
so bedraggled in the rain,

00:11:10.718 --> 00:11:14.820
and said, "What you have said is true,

00:11:14.844 --> 00:11:17.519
and we must bow to the will of the people.

00:11:18.238 --> 00:11:20.847
If you'll clear enough space
for us to turn around,

00:11:20.871 --> 00:11:22.725
we'll go back the way we came."

00:11:23.272 --> 00:11:24.630
And that's what they did.

00:11:25.102 --> 00:11:30.076
Sometimes, forging meaning
can give you the vocabulary you need